# Consecutive repetition (specification p08, p09).

== p08_three_in_a_row
property: a |-> b[*3]
clause: 16.9.2 16.12.7
class: normative
sample : 0 1 2 3
a      : 1 . . .
b      : 1 1 1 .
pass   : . . 1 .

== p08_gap_fails
property: a |-> b[*3]
clause: 16.9.2 16.12.7
class: normative
sample : 0 1 2 3
a      : 1 . . .
b      : 1 1 . 1
fail   : . . 1 .

== p09_first_match_passes
property: a |-> b[*2:5]
clause: 16.9.2 16.12.7
class: normative
sample : 0 1 2 3 4 5 6
a      : 1 . . . . . .
b      : 1 1 1 1 1 1 .
pass   : . 1 . . . . .

== p09_too_short
property: a |-> b[*2:5]
clause: 16.9.2 16.12.7
class: normative
sample : 0 1 2 3
a      : 1 . . .
b      : 1 . 1 .
fail   : . 1 . .

== p09_overlapping
property: a |-> b[*2:5]
clause: 16.9.2 16.12.7
class: normative
sample : 0 1 2 3 4
a      : 1 1 . . .
b      : 1 1 . . .
fail   : . . 1 . .
pass   : . 1 . . .
